# PDF storage notes
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For the Vercel-hosted preview deploy, PDFs are committed to the repo and
# shipped as static assets. Vercel's per-file limit of 100 MB accommodates
# the four sample issues (largest is ~93 MB). GitHub will warn on files
# above 50 MB; that warning is expected and safe to ignore for these.
#
# Once the catalog grows past ~10 issues, or before going to a host with
# stricter per-file limits (e.g., Cloudflare Pages caps at 25 MB), move
# PDFs to object storage (R2, Supabase Storage, S3) and uncomment the
# exclusion rule below to stop tracking them in git.
# /public/issues/*.pdf

# Cover thumbnails are small (~150 KB each) and safe to commit.

